The two headers in this directory are copied unchanged from shadPS4
(https://github.com/shadps4-emu/shadPS4, externals/gcn/include/gcn/ at
commit ff1b7a2e87eef8f301377e0cabbbeeeb73cc3b49). They are AMD's register offset and PM4 opcode headers.
shadPS4 keeps them without a separate license file; each header carries the
license below in its own comment. The copyright lines are those of the
headers: 2014-2021 for si_ci_vi_merged_offset.h, 2015-2021 for
si_ci_vi_merged_pm4_it_opcodes.h.

